{"step_index":1322,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T02:55:55Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T11:55:55+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T11:55:59+09:00\nThe search for \"\"464-0761\" \"부산\"\" returned the following summary:\n문의하신 \"464-0761\" 번호와 \"부산\"이라는 키워드로 검색한 결과, 해당 번호가 부산 지역의 기관이나 업체와 연결된다는 정보는 찾을 수 없었습니다 [2.1].\n\n검색 결과에서 확인된 \"464-0761\" 번호들은 주로 미국 내 업체(조지아주, 미네소타주 등)의 연락처이거나 다른 국가의 문서 번호 등과 관련된 것이었습니다[1][2][3][4][5][6].\n\n혹시 해당 번호가 특정 업체나 기관의 전화번호라면, 지역번호(051)를 포함하여 다시 확인해 보시거나 정확한 명칭을 함께 검색해 보시는 것을 권장합니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [hvammurhus.is](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHhSuvFPHGsDcy3iN6vbmb3st-v8ye7-gsiH1RxHlAULGc2UNGX10BrJfUsBioARmNmSx3aF8qLC9_rDcQMWQAMwMhLPNoh0y8l_n40GcRVuBdmqm8eAP3MzA4rtu1GCnUqXqc=)\n[2] [dot.gov](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlwdTOezRuaGp11b0SbZBDOjx2G92NOIkNIxkGquvknjmDU_lhsq8maz0I_DFA85Cibx7arw0qAhoqtyGMjRxmwRDjobPWznDfILJ1lUnPMVRYczT2uJAm4Bh3ljStIDqtffB7-dhZy428FRk8pqZZ16Er3AlaYL9X-K44w8A1othvenxNeSxln55Dl_vJ_dfKsRiuuyWIlCGCp5QoYy8N)\n[3] [georgiarailroad.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGSwM6nSWvSZddIBazb5VoqcgnC_vJ2LgH0HgsEORlhTW-QsNvE_HscLzsexeQ45a89_YJj-pwKX5YV4LdhcAZQuPBZSq1puqxFJn2DD-PsvvzV3AlvGyd5jfhvtDdYPRAuOA_EIyH-a3Ca5A==)\n[4] [lawnandgardendirectory.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaEc1azh-6F8SvRWqMDWWHwtaHTKeRIAtdzJJZ0O8czIWleM7RHWmUULV0SP7st0V3Kk4-uAbML7IcUjdAO8baHAtunI_I_c_t0Fp3BYi7sRyABn1fNDxL9g9Pn-BCUEX9uNI7T5R7QVccQdH1fiqEpH4M10QG1wj-)\n[5] [bbb.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEdwuSNsBhEB279Pp9KUu2NSt42PFxiFTV1H_CRJvPYyqMTF0HiI5dLWGtWwqYMcJAw-up-5tuV6NGBvaAPSL3YAY6TfW0SqkrFon981KEM4JuRyUUPH1lohoRtK_kcCrEkrZA9FtvSxvqctQv_bw==)\n[6] [jrcustomplating.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHYg_hwqZVWJTqEhQDH93-4Z2Yf6KlAHSPt0BPvUP1S67tO3nJ8yGQ