{"step_index":1324,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T02:56:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T11:56:05+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T11:56:07+09:00\nThe search for \"\"초량동 1196-9\" OR (\"초량동\" \"금강빌딩\" \"동화\")\" returned the following summary:\n부산광역시 동구 초량동 1196-9번지에 관한 정보는 다음과 같습니다.\n\n*   **도로명 주소:** 부산광역시 동구 중앙대로226번길 7-6[1][2]\n*   **관련 시설:** 해당 주소지에는 중식당 **'한양각'**이 위치해 있습니다[3][4].\n\n'초량동', '금강빌딩', '동화'라는 키워드 조합과 관련하여, 부산 초량동 내에서 해당 명칭을 포함하는 특정 건물을 직접적으로 연결하는 정보는 검색 결과에서 확인되지 않았습니다 [1.2.1~1.2.9]. 참고로, 다른 지역에는 '금강빌딩'이나 '동화빌딩'이라는 명칭의 건물이 다수 존재합니다[5][6][7][8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [zippoom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEb7-p-bXe2DeKTdArgAaZFniUhzyzReE5y0Y6ibwXqbGoNdsL4dX3c--VwQfBba3IcmJlotqi4qut57K8PN7c6gthz7CBCyW5ClSnOFatNclSkDx4If2MiqSJDbXv84qc7HqpZNawRJcOftQa_81zvr17zoJsWa5mcclg4VO6mhaQBnCTLplAEhQk85iKoB2eGvVTVIEKjbvoiPOvVk0eqPVBF7PtXJiwNQ72OsDrSZ-uq0m7P)\n[2] [youbianku.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhfCsN9Zl10md2u6R6dNPbHvLboyd2OWqRlWuufGVFMiYeoxdwl4BWmThIDDaPBWaMSLj6NaVXiup0Mr28uzeSuz-rRhQv5nAVSdOuiDPxYZjSnooKuyJckD9ieCSvixl_vNJVHuCadhDbabGLbpJKBliYudNdE165IA==)\n[3] [siksinhot.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE5P3NtS37Mhc0IsD9JDLT91oGVn4W2jSGyVNgEII42rvi-gQTfZB2GtbCw8YZ1JZcHI0afgEkTQHQH9bd5wI_Yxx8rytEdX7FUlI48dAqBP9adPGc-b5vy)\n[4] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEd5GoUO2f6lh9HrDt3XLj_-WUQ3_IWQYiaWFMfIaQ0xL4ynecTSkYTvDJYopebLaN6xYFKKVEF1-d_1Ry2UWwD5xYFMduJZl5lekU29BggrebZYZaIDEA-kJcxqO1zEbikR4XeCZb6d2UbBTp7bsbBe1fTPsQR75KdHU04M7Y7gVS4butoXNbuQ1VT7jtp5yrXw6m9LzHASKjpLQWDyA_VZD46iczvxc7iTRuQENMwUjpokMjZf2N7reFzf6BO6Gzr9D_cRAFINkhdzBtkprAnji9jIn6l-so0_hD47FrPSvDcuk4E)\n[5] [remodeling.or.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG8axu0SknUCDDIBC1vRB8p1iQS5H4r6U5BiNLlhxmPJ_dLkp27YJ9FazB-7WhezvvjOWdGTaG9vmHAkjDaA